      "content_html": "<img src=\"https://i0.wp.com/boingboing.net/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/deliria-2-mondo-2000.jpg?fit=1200%2C675&amp;quality=60&amp;ssl=1\" style=\"width:100%;max-height:300px;object-fit:cover;\" />\n<a href=\"https://boingboing.net/2026/07/27/deliria-2-mondo-2000.html\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"Cyberpunks, mutants, and mondoids gather in San Francisco in August\"><img alt=\"Deliria 2 — Deliria 2 event art / Gray Area (promotional)\" class=\"webfeedsFeaturedVisual wp-post-image\" height=\"675\" src=\"https://i0.wp.com/boingboing.net/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/deliria-2-mondo-2000.jpg?fit=1200%2C675&amp;quality=60&amp;ssl=1\" style=\"display: block; margin: auto; margin-bottom: 5px;\" width=\"1200\" /></a><p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Gray Area in San Francisco hands its Grand Theater to the 1990s techno-counterculture on August 12 and 13, when R.U. Sirius and the crowd behind the cyberculture magazine <em>Mondo 2000</em> stage their <a href=\"https://grayarea.org/event/deliria-2-cyberpunks-mutants-mondoids/\">second Deliria gathering</a> — two days of film, talks, music, and performance. &#8212; <a class=\"read-more\" href=\"https://boingboing.net/2026/07/27/deliria-2-mondo-2000.html\">Read the rest </a></p>\n<p>The post <a href=\"https://boingboing.net/2026/07/27/deliria-2-mondo-2000.html\">Cyberpunks, mutants, and mondoids gather in San Francisco in August</a> appeared first on <a href=\"https://boingboing.net\">Boing Boing</a>.</p>",
